{"id": "EUVD-2026-96557", "enisaUuid": "e017c3dd-180f-3776-a76d-ba33acac5a46", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows low-privileged authenticated users to modify message templates via PUT /sys/message/sysMessageTemplate/edit. Attackers can obtain template ids from the unguarded list endpoint and overwrite system notification titles and content, delivering attacker-supplied text or links to other users.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T02:31:01", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_c093_messagetemplate_edit.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/message/controller/SysMessageTemplateController.java#L94-L98", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sysmessagetemplate-edit-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-62h4-2q5j-hw9m", "CVE-2026-108618"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c5d255de-6762-3b34-88da-3f2ae264ff45", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9fe81ac9-3a48-382e-bd06-9088e72dfd7a", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}